---
// PromoSuite component to cross-promote the SaaS product on services pages
---

<section class="py-24 px-6 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#090d16] to-[#020617] border-t border-slate-800/40 relative overflow-hidden">
  <!-- Glow Overlay -->
  <div class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[800px] h-[300px] rounded-full bg-meg-accent/5 blur-[120px] pointer-events-none"></div>

  <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl relative z-10">
    <div class="relative group">
      <!-- Glow border effect -->
      <div class="absolute -inset-0.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-meg-accent/30 to-indigo-500/30 rounded-3xl blur opacity-25 group-hover:opacity-40 transition duration-700" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      
      <div class="relative bg-meg-surface-dark/60 backdrop-blur-xl border border-slate-800/40 p-8 sm:p-14 rounded-3xl meg-glass grid lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-center">
        <!-- Text content (col-span-8) -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-8 text-center lg:text-left">
          <span class="gsap-fadein text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-meg-accent bg-meg-accent/10 border border-meg-accent/20 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 mb-6">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-table-cells-large text-xs"></i>
            Entwicklungs-Beschleuniger
          </span>
          <h3 class="gsap-fadein text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-meg-text-primary-dark tracking-tight mb-4">
            Das Fundament: <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-meg-accent to-indigo-400">Die Waldheim Suite</span>
          </h3>
          <p class="gsap-fadein text-base text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Warum bei Null anfangen? Viele meiner Individual-Softwareprojekte bauen auf der <strong>Waldheim Suite</strong> als robustem Kern auf (CRM, ERP, DMS & SSO). Dadurch sparen Sie bis zu <strong>50% der Entwicklungszeit und -kosten</strong>. Wir müssen grundlegende Administrations- und Standardfunktionen nicht neu programmieren, sondern konzentrieren uns zu 100% auf Ihre individuellen Spezialanforderungen.
          </p>
          <div class="gsap-fadein flex flex-wrap justify-center lg:justify-start gap-x-6 gap-y-2 text-xs text-slate-400">
            <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-emerald-400"></i> Fertiges Kundenportal & SSO</span>
            <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-emerald-400"></i> XRechnung & ZUGFeRD PDF</span>
            <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-emerald-400"></i> DSGVO-konforme Server</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Call to Action (col-span-4) -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-4 flex flex-col sm:flex-row lg:flex-col gap-4 w-full justify-center">
          <a
            href="/suite/"
            class="gsap-fadein w-full inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-6 py-4 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-meg-accent to-sky-600 text-white font-bold shadow-lg shadow-meg-accent/20 hover:scale-[1.02] hover:shadow-meg-accent/35 active:scale-[0.98] transition-all cursor-pointer"
          >
            <i class="fa-solid fa-table-cells-large"></i>
            Suite kennenlernen
          </a>
          <a
            href="https://suite.waldheim.dev"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="gsap-fadein w-full inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-6 py-4 rounded-xl bg-meg-surface-dark border border-meg-border-dark text-meg-text-primary-dark font-bold hover:border-meg-accent/40 hover:bg-slate-900/40 transition-all cursor-pointer"
          >
            <i class="fa-solid fa-play"></i>
            Live-Demo testen
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
